    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34750" root="فهو" body-key="f">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَاهٍ</span></b> , formed by transposition from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَائِهٌ</span>, A man
<i>who reveals,</i> or <i>discloses, everything that is in his
mind;</i> like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَاوُوهَةٌ</span>; (Fr, in S and TA, art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فوه</span>;)
and so <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَاهٌ</span>: (Fr, in TA ibid.:) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَاهٍ بِجُوعِهِ</span> one
<i>who reveals his hunger.</i> (TA ibid.)

